---
// The one picture of CretLink: who runs what, what travels between the two
// computers, and what never leaves the technician's computer.
---

<figure class="overview not-content">
  <div class="ov-grid">
    <section class="ov-computer tech">
      <h3>Technician's computer <span>Windows or macOS</span></h3>
      <div class="ov-box ai">
        <strong>Your AI agent</strong>
        <span>Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI or another MCP client</span>
      </div>
      <p class="ov-hop" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 12 22" width="12" height="22"><path d="M6 0v17M1.5 12.5 6 17l4.5-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></path></svg>
        asks for a command or a file
      </p>
      <p class="ov-sr">The AI agent asks CretLink for a command or a file.</p>
      <div class="ov-box app">
        <strong>CretLink · Give help</strong>
        <span>Passes the request on, shows every action and keeps the audit trail</span>
      </div>
      <p class="ov-note keep">Stays here: your AI account, tokens and keys.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="ov-link">
      <p class="ov-link-title">One attended session</p>
      <div class="ov-arrow">
        <span>commands and files</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 12" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 6h112" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></path><path d="M106 1.5 112 6l-6 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="ov-arrow back">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 12" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 6h112" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></path><path d="M14 1.5 8 6l6 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></path></svg>
        <span>results and what happened</span>
      </div>
      <p class="ov-link-note">Direct, on the same network.<br />Encrypted from end to end.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="ov-computer cust">
      <h3>Customer's computer <span>Windows</span></h3>
      <div class="ov-box app">
        <strong>CretLink · Get help</strong>
        <span>Started by the customer. Does the work with the rights the customer allowed.</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="ov-rights" aria-label="What the customer does">
        <li>starts</li>
        <li>approves</li>
        <li>watches</li>
        <li>stops</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="ov-note none">Not here: no AI program, no AI account, no API key. Nothing is installed.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The AI agent runs on the technician's computer and reaches the customer's computer only through one
    session that the customer started and approved.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .overview { margin: 2rem 0; }
  .ov-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(9.5rem, 0.62fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .ov-computer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.05rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--cl-line);
    border-top-width: 3px;
    border-radius: 0.7rem;
    background: var(--cl-panel);
  }
  .ov-computer.tech { border-top-color: var(--cl-tech-line); }
  .ov-computer.cust { border-top-color: var(--cl-cust-line); }
  .ov-computer h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cl-muted);
  }
  .ov-computer h3 span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }
  .ov-box {
    padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--cl-line);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-black);
  }
  .ov-box strong { display: block; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .ov-box span { display: block; margin-top: 0.2rem; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .ov-box.ai { border-color: var(--cl-ai-line); background: var(--cl-ai-soft); }
  .ov-box.ai strong { color: var(--cl-ai); }
  .tech .ov-box.app { border-color: var(--cl-tech-line); background: var(--cl-tech-soft); }
  .tech .ov-box.app strong { color: var(--cl-tech); }
  .cust .ov-box.app { border-color: var(--cl-cust-line); background: var(--cl-cust-soft); }
  .cust .ov-box.app strong { color: var(--cl-cust); }
  .ov-hop {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 0 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--cl-muted);
  }
  .ov-sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ov-note {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  .ov-rights {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .ov-rights li {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.12rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--cl-cust-line);
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cl-cust);
  }
  .ov-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ov-link-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cl-muted);
  }
  .ov-arrow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; color: var(--cl-tech); }
  .ov-arrow.back { color: var(--cl-cust); }
  .ov-arrow span { font-size: 0.84rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .ov-arrow svg { width: 100%; height: 12px; }
  .ov-link-note { margin: 0; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--cl-muted); }
  .overview figcaption { margin-top: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--cl-muted); text-align: center; }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .ov-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ov-link { padding: 0.4rem 0; }
    .ov-arrow svg { display: none; }
    .ov-arrow span::after { content: '  ↓'; }
    .ov-arrow.back span::after { content: '  ↑'; }
  }
</style>
